  abilityName: Wolven Frenzy
  abilityDesc: 26 combo Earth attack on all foes (consecutive uses boost damage),
    7 combo Earth attack on single foe, boosts BB Atk for 3 turns, boosts damage
    against status afflicted foes for 3 turns, probable random status ailments infliction
    & extra action for self for 1 turn
